OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner pays #3k to avoid NHS
OL,4,Aeye surgery wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pensioner says he plans to pay nearly
OL,7,F#3,000 for private cataract surgery
OL,8,Fafter being told he faces a minimum
OL,9,F16-week NHS wait.
OL,11,FDuncan Robertson, 70, from Kent, said
OL,12,Fhe was "desperate" for the treatment as
OL,13,Fhe feared delays would affect his
OL,14,Findependence and quality of life.
OL,16,FHe said the situation created a
OL,17,F"two-tier system" in which people who
OL,18,Fcan afford private treatment are seen
OL,19,Fsooner.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
