OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner pays #3k to avoid NHS
OL,4,Aeye surgery wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Kent and Medway said routine
OL,7,Fcataract patients across the area could
OL,8,Fexpect surgery no sooner than 16 weeks
OL,9,Fafter referral and that those with the
OL,10,Fgreatest clinical need continued to be
OL,11,Fprioritised.
